## Why This Is Asked
Assesses end-to-end Azure fundamentals: service choices, CI/CD, security basics, and governance for a beginner scenario.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Static Web Apps, Azure Functions (Consumption), Azure SQL Database
- GitHub Actions CI/CD, CORS, TLS, custom domains
- Azure Policy tagging, Cost Management budgets

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: lightweight smoke test (pseudo)
describe('smoke', ()=> {
  it('SPA loads', async ()=> {
    const res = await fetch('<SPA_URL>')
    if (!res.ok) throw new Error('SPA failed to load')
  })
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you add a custom domain to Static Web Apps and migrate the TLS certs?
- What changes would you make to support multi-environment deployments (dev/stage/prod)?
